   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0416_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>dʾṭynwndʾṭ MN ẔK Y ʿL bwnˈ //[
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>SWSYʾ Y sʾhṭkˈ Y yẕdʾnpʾṭʾl (MN) [.?.]
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>sp̄ndrmṭ Y BYRḤ mṭrˈ Y ŠN[Ṭ ...?]
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>prʾc ʾywmʾhkˈ lʾd ŠG
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>G-X-II ʾsp̄sṭˈ C-$$X
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>glṭˈ ṬBNʾ-I W PRG
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>pṭmʾn ʿL lsykʾn
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>Y yẕdnpʾṭʾl
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>yẕdnpʾṭʾl
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>ḤṬY(MWN)ṭ   ○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0416_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Dādēnwindād az ān ī ō bun //[
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>asp ī sāxtag ī Yazdānpādār (az rōz)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>Spandarmad ī māh Mihr ī sā[l ...]
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>frāz ēw-māhag rāy ǰaw
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>grīw 12 aspast 150
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>gird kāh 1 ud nēm
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>paymān ō rahīgān
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>ī Yazdānpādār
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>dād čak
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>Yazdānpādār
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>āwišt     ○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0416_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>[1] Dādēnwindād from that which (belongs) to the bun, [2] for the *trained horse of Yazdānpādār (from day) [3] Spandaimad (5th day) of month Mihr (7th month) of the ye[ar . . .?] [4] for the duration of one month [5-7] 12 grīw of barley, 150 bundles of lucerne, 1 and a half of a measurement of straw to the boys [8] of Yazdānpādār [9-11] given. Yazdānpādār sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>